289 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (The proposed Business Intelligence solution transforms fragmented cross-channel marketing data into a unified analytical framework for customer journey analysis. By integrating GA4, campaign expenditure, and other marketing data sources, the system provides a consistent view of customer interactions. The automated Python ETL pipeline cleans, validates, and prepares the data for reliable analysis. A MySQL Star Schema provides a structured foundation for scalable analytical queries. SQL views and reconciled DAX measures enable consistent KPI and funnel calculations. Power BI then converts these processed datasets into interactive and actionable insights. The analysis identifies significant leakage across the customer conversion journey, particularly at the Landing Page to Product View stage. Channel, campaign, device, and demographic analysis further reveal differences in marketing performance and customer behaviour. These insights can support informed decisions regarding budget allocation, landing-page improvements, and mobile checkout optimization. Overall, the solution demonstrates how Business Intelligence can convert complex marketing data into actionable funnel intelligence and support data-driven decision-making.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
